      "title": "Blue Jays Beat White Sox 1-0",
      "paragraphs": [
        "The **Blue Jays** found their identity in a crucial 1-0 win over the White Sox last night, improving their record to 46-52 as they sit fifth in the AL East. Today, the teams meet again at Rogers Centre for a 12:15 PM ET game on Sportsnet, where fans can seek another pitching-dominated outing.",
        "Offseason focus shifts to the **Leafs**, who are preparing for the 2026-27 season with their first game against the Canadiens set for Tuesday, September 29. The **Raptors** are generating buzz around forward Allen Graves, whose summer play has already changed fan perspectives on his potential. Meanwhile, **Commanders** training camp is underway with quarterback Jayden Daniels driving a more convincing and hopeful atmosphere for the upcoming season.",
        "The Commanders' next scheduled game is against the Eagles on Sunday, September 13, while the Jays face the White Sox again today at noon."
